      refine ⟨weilPolyP1CohomologyRepHomEquiv Y V 𝒥 ξ, ?_⟩
      change (α.hom.app (Opposite.op V)) (weilPolyP1CohomologyRepHomEquiv Y V 𝒥 ξ) = s
